# allowlist: only what `go build .` needs, so local state and secrets
# (config, share.key, certs, downloads) can't reach a local build context.
# A new top-level package directory must be added here; the Docker build job fails until it is.
*
!go.mod
!go.sum
!*.go
!engine/
!server/
!static/
# the allowed directories come back whole, so state that could be written
# inside them (share.key and certs sit next to the config) is excluded again
**/share.key
**/certs
**/downloads
**/cloud-fetch.json
**/cloud-torrent.json
